# Skills installed with `npx skills add`.
#
# The skill itself is vendored — .agents/skills/**/SKILL.md is committed,
# so a clone has it without running anything, and so a diff shows when it
# changes. That file is the source of truth here.
#
# skills-lock.json is committed beside it for provenance only. Its
# computedHash does NOT verify the vendored file: it matches neither the
# bytes on disk, the body, the frontmatter, nor any path or source
# prefix, under sha256, sha1 or sha512 — it is computed over something
# upstream. Useful for saying where this came from, not for checking it.
#
# The symlink is not. .claude/skills holds a link into .agents written
# with an ABSOLUTE path, so it resolves on this machine and nowhere else.
.claude/skills/
